        <h2>{{ site.yearsInBusiness }} Years. One Standard.</h2>
        <p>We started this company in {{ site.founded }} with a simple idea: HVAC work shouldn't be confusing or expensive for no good reason. You should know exactly what's wrong, exactly what it costs to fix it, and exactly what you're getting.</p>
        <p>That approach has kept us in business for {{ site.yearsInBusiness }} years on almost entirely referral work. We don't run misleading coupons, we don't upsell maintenance visits into unnecessary repairs, and we don't swap out parts that don't need swapping.</p>
        <p>Every technician we send to your home is a licensed Florida HVAC contractor — not a helper or a subcontractor. They're trained to diagnose properly and explain what they find in plain language. If the repair makes sense, we say so. If replacement makes more sense, we tell you that too, with numbers to back it up.</p>
